{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e04a2004-3cca-8cc6-8f5b-1b8c5f1cccc6",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T14:24:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Denise, and thank you for taking my call. My name is Hector Herrera. I am calling about a storm drain, if you would be so kind. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Herrera. What's going on with it, and where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:21:34-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. It is at 223 Mill Street, up on the Historic Hill. The drain at the corner is not taking any water. After the coastal storm that ended Saturday, two days ago, the water has just sat there. It is still there today, I am sorry to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two days later and still standing? Okay. How much water are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:22:02-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is pooled all the way across the crosswalk by the school bus stop. The children are stepping out into the road to get around it, and the cars do not slow down. I do not like it at all. Thank you for listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's not good, with the kids out there. Let me get that noted as a priority. Is it going anywhere, or just sitting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is moving, yes, thank you for asking. It is running slowly toward my neighbor's garage, the one next to me. I am afraid it will go under the door. [pause] I am sorry, the line is not so good, I am on my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're coming through fine. So it's heading toward the neighbor's garage. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Denise, may I ask you something? When did the city last come by to clean this drain? Because nobody has been here that I have seen, and I have watched the corner every day this winter. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:23:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning log in front of me, I'd have to ask the crew supervisor what the last visit was. I can put the question in with your report, though, and have somebody get back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be very kind. Thank you. I would only say, with respect, that it is a shame to have to call about this. The water has been there since the storm, and I do not think anyone has looked at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:23:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Two days is too long with a crosswalk underwater. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:23:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. It is 401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:24:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-eight. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:24:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send a crew request for the drain at Mill Street, mark the bus stop and the neighbor's garage, and ask about the last cleaning. Crews are stretched after the storm, but this one's going up near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. I appreciate it. I must go now, if you will excuse me. I am on my way to return a toaster to the store. It burns everything, every single slice. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you don't need that. Good luck with the return, Mr. Herrera."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And thank you again for your help. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
